    "summary": "The Lord sends word to many nations that they are to serve Babylon—The vessels of the Lord’s house will go into Babylon.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "In the beginning of the reign of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah came this word unto Jeremiah from the Lord, saying,",
